0..77 Comment "// A capability a scope introduces lives in that scope\'s region, and its type"
78..156 Comment "// says so: `Cap {exit} at c` is the capability living until the scope binding"
157..223 Comment "// `c` ends. Regions follow Tofte and Talpin (_Region-Based Memory"
224..299 Comment "// Management_, doi:10.1006/inco.1996.2613): a value of an outer region may"
300..344 Comment "// stand in an inner one, never the reverse."
